Resistor Calculations
LED transistor resistor:
The I_OL of the LVCMOS 3.3 is 8 mA.. According to the 2N3906 datasheet, the I_B of the transistor is I_C/10, which, in this case, is 0.0056 A. The V_BE of the transistor is typically 0.7 V. Therefore, the resistor value can be calculated as follows: \[R_{LED\:transistor} = \frac{3.3V-0.4V-0.7V}{0.0056A} \approx 470Ω\]
Keypad transistor resistor:
According to the 2N3904 datasheet, the I_B of the transistor is I_C/10, where I_C is 0.02 A. The V_BE of the transistor is typically 0.7 V. Therefore, the resistor value can be calculated as follows: \[R_{keypad\:transistor} = \frac{3.3V-0.7V}{0.002A} \approx 1000Ω\]



